{"id":"en_the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo","title":"The True Heiress Saves the CEO","titleEn":"The True Heiress Saves the CEO","description":"A decade after Arielle, heir to the Moore family, was taken by human traffickers and vanished, she comes back home. In the years away she has built a formidable set of abilities, mastering medicine and martial arts, accumulating great wealth abroad, and earning the backing of an influential CEO whose life she saved by chance. Her return has a purpose: she intends to discover what really happened surrounding the unexplained death of Maureen, her biological mother. Those following this story can watch it unfold on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Underdog Rise","Urban","True Love","Revenge","Female"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpcc/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-true-heiress-saves-the-ceo_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble